<p><strong>PERSONAL DEVELOPMENT:</strong><br><em>IAESTE represents an excellent opportunity to prepare for your professional future. Not only will you learn how to work nationally, but you will also develop your presentation, event management, human resources, information technology and public relations skills. Take advantage of the opportunity to develop in what you are passionate about!</em></p>

