<p><strong>INTERNATIONALIZATION</strong>:<br><em>With IAESTE, the limits go far beyond. Access an international network of students, paid internships, amazing experiences and events. IAESTE is an exchange program in a globalized environment where students from around the globe share their interests and collaborate on projects to work towards common goals.</em></p>

