<p><strong>EXPAND YOUR NETWORK:</strong><br><em>At IAESTE, you can expand your connections and broaden your professional network. In addition, you will connect with people from all continents, experiencing the cultural differences that enrich exchange and coexistence. Through our joint work and our mission, our volunteers establish lasting friendships around the world</em></p>

